.SS " str sphinx\&.ext\&.inheritance_diagram\&.InheritanceGraph\&._format_node_attrs ( self, dict[str, float | int | str] attrs)\fC [protected]\fP"

.SS " str sphinx\&.ext\&.inheritance_diagram\&.InheritanceGraph\&._generate_dot ( self, str name, dict[str, str] | None  urls = \fCNone\fP, \fBConfig\fP | None  config = \fCNone\fP, dict[str, float | int | str] | None  graph_attrs = \fCNone\fP, dict[str, float | int | str] | None  node_attrs = \fCNone\fP, dict[str, float | int | str] | None  edge_attrs = \fCNone\fP)\fC [protected]\fP"

.PP
.nf
Generate a graphviz dot graph from the classes that were passed in
to __init__\&.

*name* is the name of the graph\&.

*urls* is a dictionary mapping class names to HTTP URLs\&.

*graph_attrs*, *node_attrs*, *edge_attrs* are dictionaries containing
key/value pairs to pass on as graphviz properties\&.

.fi
